run []: exit 0
== commands
brew tap anomalyco/tap <>
brew tap gentleman-programming/tap <>
brew list --formula <>
brew install uv <>
brew install worktrunk <>
brew install agent-browser <>
brew install gentleman-programming/tap/engram <>
agent-browser install <>
engram setup claude-code <y>
engram setup opencode <>
wt config shell install --yes zsh <>
opencode models <>
claude mcp remove --scope user agent-browser <>
claude mcp add --scope user agent-browser -- $SHIMS/agent-browser mcp <>
claude mcp remove --scope user engram <>
claude mcp add --scope user engram -- $SHIMS/engram mcp --tools=agent <>
claude plugin list --json <>
claude mcp get agent-browser <>
claude mcp get engram <>
opencode debug config <>
claude plugin validate $BASE/tmp/harness-assets-<n>/skills <>
wt switch --help <>
wt list --help <>
